get.description:
Return the UI-safe gamma term dictionary.

Shape:
```
{
  "terms": {
    "king": {
      "canonical": "King",
      "short_definition": "...",
      "long_definition": "...",
      "math": "..."
    },
    ...
  },
  "version": "1"
}
```

Cached aggressively (1 hour client-side); the underlying dict is a
module constant that only changes on deploy.
